"Next level" pass for the Warrior Zone kids app, built entirely as self-installing
modules that fail safe. No edits to the core bundles — safer to review and deploy.

Visuals: the Locker, Welcome, and Mascot use the app's real illustrated (and
animated) warrior art keyed to the kid's avatar. A cohesive custom SVG icon set
(wz-icons.js, Lucide/Linear style in the app's gold) replaces the emoji app-wide:
the Locker, the Welcome steps, the armor tab grid + "next piece" line, the Sticker
Shelf, the Hall of Victory headers, the daily mission, and the Daily Gift.

New (kgz/app/features/):
- wz-icons.js: window.wzIcon(name,size) — armor (belt/breastplate/boots/shield/
  helmet/sword/full) + UI icons (target/gift/star/flame/book/trophy/heart/play/bolt).
- welcome.js: first-login "Welcome, Warrior" moment with the kid's illustrated
  warrior, Ephesians 6:10 (ESV), icon-based how-it-works.
- mascot.js: "Warrior Buddy" — the kid's warrior as a circular corner buddy that
  bobs, waves on tab changes, cheers on points, encourages when tapped.
- warrior-locker.js: hero view — the kid's illustrated/animated warrior in a
  glowing frame; earned armor pieces (custom icons) light up in sequence; each
  teaches its Ephesians 6 verse (ESV).
- daily-gift.js: "Today's Blessing" daily verse-of-the-day chest (ESV).
- streaks.js: streak strip + 12-sticker shelf (custom icons); Hall of Victory
  header icons.
- today-plus.js / armor-fix.js / polish.js / juice.js: daily mission, corrected
  armor thresholds + armor-tab icons, motion polish, game sound + haptics.
- books-game.js / fruit-game.js / heroes-game.js: three new age-aware Arena games
  (Arena 6 -> 12).

All Scripture passed the biblical-soundness review (ESV). Scripts load last in
index.html with content-hash cache-busting; SW bumped wz-v2 -> wz-v3. Verified in
headless Chromium: 13 modules self-install, new games register, Locker/Welcome/
armor/stickers render the real art and custom icon set, no script errors.

